{"file_name": "Untitled design (7).png", "id": "760533521614935", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001703_760533524948268_5929132528678025364_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5AbyKxf0qwQ7kNvwG4N_Os&_nc_oc=AdoTXy0nmvBtO_gBj__h5hhi5gNcZXA707J6JnwAOfKS9WmESCqlvWy5T9tnEfQWpDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx6ffn__sxSLVV9QOsIba4tTV7uN_DSUVS3LPQGSS2a9g&oe=69D11E8E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "THE RETRIEVAL (2).png", "id": "1059497764697325", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982500_1059497768030658_269254459267951193_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QJ9rPCuXi48Q7kNvwHz9jer&_nc_oc=AdpX6F4Z-2hiAbSjIyb85i2ysWY_3eVxC2v6q5e3RNB6JjopfSrTh73JCcpFUcbocLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxim1tbEjvSRKuNQCQ5VmU_A-6sE00phhpNH4QqFd_TKw&oe=69D10813"}, "display_name": "The Retrieval", "keywords": [], "long_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taking place in the far future. Navigate your way through abandoned spaceship learning what happened to the crew.\n\n If you enjoy puzzles games and mind bending horror environments - this game is for you. And remember, the deep space can play tricks to the mind..\n\nWarning: this game contains sudden horrifying moments.\n\nThis game will receive regular updates.", "short_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taki